# Localhost browser verification

Local visual verification of `localhost` / `127.0.0.1` (including `:8780`) is allowed for
NeighbourGrid UI work. Prefer:

1. Owner or agent opens the running app and checks 390px + desktop.
2. Project commands: `npm run test:smoke`, type-check, lint, unit tests.
3. Short, intentional browser MCP checks when useful.

Do not enter long retry loops against localhost. If navigation or screenshots fail twice with
the same error, stop, report the failure, and fall back to source inspection plus smoke tests.
